# The pictures of bill-of-materials.md: examples/scripts/bom, which
# saves a plate and a bolt as parts, links them into a bracket with the
# bolt repeated, and links the bracket twice into the model; its bill
# of materials; and a density on the bracket's link group, which the
# bill turns into a mass.
file $repo/examples/scripts/bom/bom.go
menu Script|Run File...
# Saved in the working directory, beside the parts folder the example
# made there, so that the bill gives paths relative to the model: a
# relative path here on purpose.
file assembly.tlspr
menu File|Save As...
size tw 800 600
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot bill-of-materials-1-linked
menu Assembly|Bill of Materials
shot bill-of-materials-2-bill tw
# The bracket's link group, from the list of groups.
twmove 30 5
twdown L 30 5
twup L 30 5
twmove 200 155
twdown L 200 155
twup L 200 155
cursor on
twmove 676 245
mark 495 240 258 22 tw
shot bill-of-materials-3-link tw
twdown L 676 245
twup L 676 245
edit 2.7
cursor off
menu Assembly|Bill of Materials
tw
shot bill-of-materials-4-mass tw
